l  I've also acquired a kiln and the  soapstone that I'm using can be fired in  the kiln  be playing around with that firing the  soapstone adding some glazes and so  there's a whole lot of things that we're  going to explore in the carving itself  not only that but in terms of subject as  well what I intend to do is to stretch  out the subjects that I've been  exploring until now I've been doing  mostly ikon carving but now from now on  what I want to do is also look at other  types of imagery I want to explore the  whole history of early Western Byzantine  art doing some maybe fantastical beef  some ornamentation all kinds of new  images that hopefully will be appealing  to a wider audience and that might  include the people who are watching this  now so what I'm going to do is I'm going  to open up this patreon project drawing  project for just development of my craft  and if you support me on patreon you'll  still be getting stuff I'll still be  sending postcards and posters and  drawings too for people giving it 25 but  this year you might be getting a whole  lot more in terms of choice I'll be  sending out all these new projects are  doing more colorful with with colored  stone and by we might be trying to use  paint as well trying to color the  carvings trying all kinds of stuff and  hopefully so it will create a more  exciting thing that you can follow on  patreon and on social media and the  extra thing I'm going to do is all these  new things we're going to develop we're  going to offer them for all the patrons  first pick  so exclusively for patrons I'm going to  put up these carvings on patreon so if  people want to buy these these new these  new things that are coming out and then  if I see that they're not going on  patreon then I'll post them on the  website and on social media but in the  last year what I've seen is every time I  put something up for sale I usually sell  it within an hour so if you're excited  about that I would suggest that you come  join me on patreon people can start to  give even only a $2.00 a month and now  you'll get some postcards but then there  are different tiers that you can follow  depending on on what would you like to  get for me and just how excited you are  about this project join my patreon and  as usual everybody thank you for your  support and now yeah looking forward to  see what the new year is going to bring
 

